mc(2,5,"Case","“A woman who is assertive in a meeting is called bossy, while the same behaviour in a man is called leadership.” Which gender bias is this?","Likeability bias",["Attribution bias","Performance bias","Parenting bias"],"Likeability bias: women are expected to be kind rather than assertive.");
mc(3,5,"Case","A woman's success on a project is explained by “she was lucky” or “her team helped her”. This is…","Attribution bias",["Likeability bias","Performance bias","Affinity bias"],"Attribution bias: success explained by luck or help instead of skill and talent.");
